---
const faqs = [
  {
    q: "How quickly do you reply to new project inquiries?",
    a: "I review and respond to all direct contact form messages and emails within 24 hours (Monday through Saturday)."
  },
  {
    q: "What design tools & handoff formats do you deliver?",
    a: "All UI/UX projects are delivered as organized Figma source files with Auto-Layout 5.0, reusable component variants, and design token specs. Webflow builds are transferred directly to your Webflow dashboard."
  },
  {
    q: "How are payment milestones structured?",
    a: "Standard projects operate on a 50% deposit upfront to reserve schedule bandwidth, with the remaining 50% due upon final approval before file/domain transfer."
  },
  {
    q: "Do you offer white-label design services for agencies?",
    a: "Yes! I regularly partner with tech agencies, Webflow studios, and product teams on white-label UI/UX and Webflow contracts."
  }
];
---

<section class="py-16 sm:py-20 md:py-24 bg-white dark:bg-[#0d0e11] transition-colors duration-300">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 mb-3">
        Frequently Asked <span class="text-gradient">Questions</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
        Quick answers regarding project booking, deliverables, and agency contracts.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-4">
      {faqs.map((f) => (
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-200/80 dark:border-zinc-800">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 mb-2">
            {f.q}
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
            {f.a}
          </p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
